// Which Hub test files run where (vite.config.mts `test.projects`). Data only.
//
// NODE_SHARED: pure-logic tests that run in the node environment and share one worker module graph (isolate: false).
// Each one passed with identical results under happy-dom, under node, and under node with isolate:false in three shuffled
// file orders of this exact list. NODE_ISOLATED: node environment, a fresh worker per file: tests that passed
// identically in node but leave or read state across files (they failed in some shuffled shared order), and the
// source scanners (conformance / scan tests). Every other test file runs in happy-dom, the default.
//
// RULE: a file added to NODE_SHARED, or any edit to a NODE_SHARED test, needs three shuffled-order runs of the whole
// NODE_SHARED list with identical per-test results; otherwise the file goes to NODE_ISOLATED.
//
// To move a file here: run it under happy-dom and under the node project (and, for NODE_SHARED, shuffled with the
// shared list, `--sequence.shuffle`) and compare the per-test results; any difference keeps it in the web project.
// A test that needs a document, window, localStorage or Testing Library stays out. A path here that no longer exists
// matches nothing; a renamed file falls back to happy-dom, which is always safe.
